    "alert_id": "EX3_003",
    "title": "Overdue creatinine monitoring on TDF",
    "message": "Guidelines require serum creatinine and eGFR every 12 months for patients on TDF. The last creatinine was 72 umol/L on 2025-08-12, 196 days before this visit. While this is within 12 months, no creatinine has been ordered at today's visit and none is due until August 2026. However, no eGFR was reported alongside the last creatinine. The plan does not include renal monitoring.",
    "issue_type": "monitoring_gap",
    "severity": "low",
    "recommended_action": "Ensure eGFR is calculated with the next creatinine due around August 2026. If any renal risk factors develop, monitor sooner.",
